 ## 5. Recent task record
 
+### 2026-11-02 — Menus (swipe, slow exploration, tap, lens) and the « en cours » tool (task 2 of 3)
+
+- Menus (contextual rail, project ribbon, main ribbon — one pointer route): a quick swipe along a bar that scrolls scrolls it and runs nothing at its release or after; a slow exploration grows the tool under the finger and its release runs nothing; a short tap runs its tool once; a press that stops a glide is no tap; the ribbon's swipe no longer swallows the next tap; the grown tool stays whole at the bar's edge (the ribbon's Organize and Atome stay in place); a lift taken by the Mystic rests the lens. Speed threshold 0.35 px/ms at the hold tolerance (18 px touch). Reproduced on the previous code (real touches): a quick swipe opened the Créer palette at its release and did not scroll; a slow exploration scrolled instead of growing; the grown tool was cut by the Organize block.
+- « En cours »: one owner (`dashboard_ongoing_tool.js`), the orange disc of the activity (its live ring) right above the assistant on the home, over a rubric (cell kept free), in a project (the rail rises by one tool); painted above panels; it steps aside while a panel's slab or band lies on its place (the Sport card's own Stop stays touchable); one activity → its card (the same session, from a project through the Dashboard), several → « En direct »; gone when the activity ends. Found and fixed on the way: the previous ▶ was drawn under panels while its touch lay above them (an invisible target over the card's Stop); a card closed while its `start` was written lost its session id.
+- Tests: `tests/eve/menu_swipe_explore_tap.test.mjs` 6/6 (5 red on the previous code), `tests/eve/ongoing_tool.test.mjs` 2/2. Real Web app (temp probes, real CDP touches): ribbon 7/7 (3 red on the previous code), rail 12/12, rail during a session 15/15 (rail rises above the tool, exploration ending on the tool runs nothing), « en cours » 8/8, `tests/probes/r108_sport_session_web.probe.mjs` 11/11. Same pre-existing Vitest failures before and after (16 in the menu/pointer set). Guardrails green; syntax 3414 files.
+- Decisions taken from the user's explicit request (2 Nov. 2026), to confirm in AGENTS.md rule 13 (its text still says « ▶ »): the tool's look is the orange disc; its touch opens the activity's card when one runs (R-107 BUG-005 option b). Left open: keeping the tool's cell free inside panels (BUG-006 cause 2, R-107).
+- **To verify**: real fingers on an iPhone/iPad (speed threshold feel, inertia catch), left hand, eVe Basic, Tauri; the Messages-tool swipe (task 1) with a pending message.
+
+### 2026-11-02 — Dashboard swipe-up navigation (task 1 of 3)
+
+- Swipe up, read from where it starts: the home's ground or an open rubric's ground (around the plates, an empty cell), Back, Next or the ✕ in Back's place → the Dashboard's root (`leaveForHome`, a held element's tools dismissed first); the assistant → large (her existing `slideAtom`/`toCentre`); the band's Messages tool → every communication (`notifications` rubric); the field → grown three tools upward, words wrapped, same editing session (text, focus and caret kept, Return still submits), folded by a swipe down or once empty and unfocused. Taps, holds, sideways page turns and a home that scrolls keep their own routes. Owners in `maps/CODEMAP.md` (2026-11-02 entry).
+- Tests: new `tests/eve/dashboard_swipe_navigation.test.mjs` 5/5 (red on the previous code: the bricks did not exist). Real Web app (Chromium WebGPU under Xvfb, real CDP touches, temp probe `temp/swipe_r110/swipe.probe.mjs`): 13/13 on the new code, 7/13 on the previous code (the new gestures failing as expected). Back tap under a rubric 4/4 in isolation (one full-run miss traced to a tile tap withdrawn by an assistant proposal, existing behaviour). Console: three « Ignored attempt to cancel a touchstart » browser interventions, identical on the previous code. Pre-existing Vitest failures unchanged (`dashboard_eve_interactions` 4, `mystic_release_dwell_fling` 6, `bevy_ui_main_menu_contract` missing helper). Guardrails: syntax 3411 files, component reuse, no-fallbacks, DOM projection, mutation ownership, browser contract imports, empty-catch 357.
+- Kept: the Dashboard tool (`dashboard_root`) and the project's Organize handle — a swipe is not discoverable and not available to everyone (switch control, VoiceOver); removing them is a user decision.
+- **To verify**: on an iPhone and an iPad (real fingers, keyboard open, safe areas), eVe Basic, a left hand; the grown field's look (an existing glass grown, no new element) for the user's validation; the Messages tool's swipe was verified by unit routing only (no pending message in the test account).
